<title>UK: Iran buys three cargoes white sugar -traders.</title>
<headline>Iran buys three cargoes white sugar -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran bought three cargoes of white sugar for shipment dates between May and July, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>It bought two cargoes for May 15/June 15 shipment at $307.25 and $313.00, fob basis, and a further cargo for June 15/July 15 at $351.00, c &amp; f basis.</p>
<p>The sellers are as yet unknown.</p>
<p>Earlier this month, Iran was said to have bought another cargo for May 15/June 15 at around $316.00 fob.</p>
<p>-- Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
